# Production deferred transactions, keyed by file::function, with a read-only reason.
crates/striatum-store/src/catalog.rs::read_resolved_facts # SELECT-only snapshot of model facts and operator-grade overlays; no transaction writes.
crates/striatum-store/src/catalog.rs::read_selection_catalog # Reader snapshot of model facts and operator-grade overlays; no transaction writes.
crates/striatum-store/src/account_selection.rs::reconcile_account_eligibility # SELECT-only listing snapshot commits before the separate IMMEDIATE write phase.
crates/striatum-store/src/account_selection.rs::account_read # Callback contract permits reads only; admissions and observations use account_transaction.
crates/striatum-store/src/account_state.rs::refresh # State loader's single consistent read at startup, data_version reload and failed-batch reload; it never writes.
crates/striatum-store/src/prune_facts.rs::plan_unserved_prune # SELECT-only fact and recent-decision snapshot; commits before separate IMMEDIATE keyed deletes.
crates/striatum-store/src/history.rs::with_history_reader_pins # Physically read-only snapshot pins state before history. A move between the pins can only expose a duplicate (removed by key), never hide a row.
